Cell["ALP-electroweak", "Chapter", ExpressionUUID->"0c09d55d-3ef8-4fbb-a233-b482731d116a"],

Cell["Evaluate Definitions first, then this chapter. Existing bounds use gW = (Pi/alpha2) g_aWW and include the astrophysical SN1987 bound; see contours/ALP-electroweak/README.md. With no saved sensitivities this chapter plots the constraints alone.", "Text", ExpressionUUID->"7fa170a8-56a1-4e1f-b32e-35164be0f40a"],

