Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Dark-QCD-rho", "Chapter"], Cell["The laboratory exclusions follow the reference plot: NA62 at 1.4*10^17 protons on target (central, all production channels) and BaBar mumu, kept as separate contours. The NA62 contours were recovered from the saved reference plot up to Lambda^-2 = 10^-4 GeV^-2. Belle II is a projection; the thermal-equilibrium line is shown separately. These curves use r = m(rho_d)/m(pi_d) = 1.5 and decay description 2311.17157 (g = 5.7). Select sensitivities for the same benchmark.", "Text"], 
